{"task_id": "Mbpp/165", "solution": "```python\ndef count_char_position(input_string: str) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Counts characters where their 1-based alphabetical position matches their 1-based string index.\n    Non-alphabetic characters are ignored.\n    \"\"\"\n    ALPHABET_LOWERCASE = \"abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\"\n    count = 0\n    for index, char in enumerate(input_string):\n        lower_char = char.lower()\n        if lower_char in ALPHABET_LOWERCASE:\n            alphabet_pos = ALPHABET_LOWERCASE.index(lower_char) + 1\n            if alphabet_pos == (index + 1):\n                count += 1\n    return count\n```"}
