{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "```python\ndef find_lucas(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the n-th Lucas number iteratively.\n    Assumes n is a non-negative integer as per requirements.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    # Initialize with L(0) and L(1)\n    a, b = 2, 1\n    # Iterate from L(2) up to L(n)\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return b\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/389", "solution": "```python\ndef find_lucas(n: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"Calculates the n-th Lucas number using an iterative approach.\n    The sequence starts with L0=2, L1=1, and Ln = L(n-1) + L(n-2) for n > 1.\n    \"\"\"\n    if n == 0:\n        return 2\n    if n == 1:\n        return 1\n\n    # Initialize a and b with L0 and L1 respectively\n    a, b = 2, 1\n    # Iterate from the 2nd Lucas number up to the n-th\n    for _ in range(2, n + 1):\n        a, b = b, a + b\n    return b\n```"}
