{"task_id": "Mbpp/558", "solution": "```python\ndef digit_distance_nums(num1, num2):\n    \"\"\"Calculates the sum of absolute per-digit differences between two non-negative integers.\n    Shorter numbers are conceptually padded with leading zeros for comparison.\"\"\"\n    \n    str_num1 = str(num1)\n    str_num2 = str(num2)\n\n    max_len = max(len(str_num1), len(str_num2))\n\n    padded_num1 = str_num1.zfill(max_len)\n    padded_num2 = str_num2.zfill(max_len)\n\n    total_difference = 0\n    for i in range(max_len):\n        digit1 = int(padded_num1[i])\n        digit2 = int(padded_num2[i])\n        total_difference += abs(digit1 - digit2)\n\n    return total_difference\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/558", "solution": "```python\ndef digit_distance_nums(num1: int, num2: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates the sum of per-digit absolute differences between two integers.\n    Shorter numbers are padded with leading zeros for comparison.\n    \"\"\"\n    str_num1 = str(abs(num1))\n    str_num2 = str(abs(num2))\n\n    max_len = max(len(str_num1), len(str_num2))\n\n    padded_str_num1 = str_num1.zfill(max_len)\n    padded_str_num2 = str_num2.zfill(max_len)\n\n    total_difference = 0\n    for i in range(max_len):\n        digit1 = int(padded_str_num1[i])\n        digit2 = int(padded_str_num2[i])\n        total_difference += abs(digit1 - digit2)\n\n    return total_difference\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/559", "solution": "```python\ndef max_sub_array_sum(numbers: list[int], length: int) -> int:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the sum of the largest contiguous sublist in the given list.\n    Implements Kadane's algorithm.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not numbers:\n        return 0\n\n    max_so_far = numbers[0]\n    current_max = numbers[0]\n\n    for i in range(1, len(numbers)):\n        current_max = max(numbers[i], current_max + numbers[i])\n        max_so_far = max(max_so_far, current_max)\n\n    return max_so_far\n```"}
