{"task_id": "Mbpp/603", "solution": "```python\ndef get_ludic(n):\n    \"\"\"\n    Calculates all ludic numbers less than or equal to a given integer.\n    The function implements the sieving process based on the mathematical definition.\n    \"\"\"\n    class InvalidLimitError(ValueError):\n        \"\"\"Custom exception for invalid limit values in ludic number generation.\"\"\"\n        pass\n\n    if n < 0:\n        raise InvalidLimitError(\"Limit must be a non-negative integer.\")\n    if n == 0:\n        return []\n\n    candidates = list(range(1, n + 1))\n    ludic_numbers = []\n\n    while candidates:\n        current_ludic = candidates.pop(0)\n        ludic_numbers.append(current_ludic)\n\n        if current_ludic > 1:\n            indices_to_remove = []\n            for i in range(len(candidates)):\n                if (i + 1) % current_ludic == 0:\n                    indices_to_remove.append(i)\n\n            for index in reversed(indices_to_remove):\n                candidates.pop(index)\n\n    return ludic_numbers\n```"}
