{"task_id": "Mbpp/615", "solution": "```python\ndef average_tuple(data: tuple[tuple[float | int, ...], ...]) -> list[float]:\n    \"\"\"Calculate the average of numerical data within structured tuples.\n    Returns 0.0 for empty inner tuples as per business rules.\"\"\"\n    \n    results: list[float] = []\n    for inner_tuple in data:\n        if not inner_tuple:\n            results.append(0.0)\n            continue\n        \n        current_sum = sum(inner_tuple)\n        count = len(inner_tuple)\n        \n        results.append(current_sum / count)\n        \n    return results\n```"}
