{"task_id": "Mbpp/771", "solution": "BRACKET_MAP = {\n    ')': '(',\n    '}': '{',\n    ']': '[',\n}\nOPENING_BRACKETS = set(BRACKET_MAP.values())\nCLOSING_BRACKETS = set(BRACKET_MAP.keys())\n\ndef check_expression(expression: str) -> bool:\n    \"\"\"\n    Determines if a string expression has balanced brackets.\n    It uses a stack to track opening brackets and validate matches.\n    \"\"\"\n    stack = []\n    for char in expression:\n        if char in OPENING_BRACKETS:\n            stack.append(char)\n        elif char in CLOSING_BRACKETS:\n            if not stack:\n                return False\n            if stack.pop() != BRACKET_MAP[char]:\n                return False\n    return not stack"}
