{"task_id": "Mbpp/773", "solution": "```python\nimport re\nfrom typing import List, Tuple, Optional\n\ndef find_all_occurrences(target: str, sub: str) -> List[Tuple[str, int, int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds all non-overlapping occurrences of a substring within a target string.\n    Returns a list of tuples, where each tuple contains (substring, start_index, end_exclusive_index).\n    \"\"\"\n    occurrences = []\n    for match in re.finditer(re.escape(sub), target):\n        occurrences.append((match.group(0), match.start(), match.end()))\n    return occurrences\n\ndef find_first_occurrence(target: str, sub: str) -> Optional[Tuple[str, int, int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the first non-overlapping occurrence of a substring within a target string.\n    Returns a tuple for the first occurrence, or None if no occurrence is found.\n    \"\"\"\n    all_matches = find_all_occurrences(target, sub)\n    if all_matches:\n        return all_matches[0]\n    return None\n\ndef occurance_substring(target: str, sub: str) -> Optional[Tuple[str, int, int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the first occurrence and position of a substring within a string.\n    Returns None if there is no match.\n    \"\"\"\n    return find_first_occurrence(target, sub)\n```"}
{"task_id": "Mbpp/773", "solution": "```python\nfrom typing import Optional, Tuple\n\ndef occurance_substring(main_string: str, sub_string: str) -> Optional[Tuple[str, int, int]]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Finds the first occurrence and position of a substring within a string.\n    Returns a tuple (substring, start_index, end_index) if found, otherwise None.\n    \"\"\"\n    start_index = main_string.find(sub_string)\n    if start_index != -1:\n        end_index = start_index + len(sub_string)\n        return (sub_string, start_index, end_index)\n    return None\n```"}
