{"task_id": "Mbpp/778", "solution": "```python\ndef pack_consecutive_duplicates(elements: list) -> list[list]:\n    \"\"\"\n    Packs consecutive duplicate elements of a list into sublists.\n    It iterates through the list, grouping identical adjacent items.\n    \"\"\"\n    if not elements:\n        return []\n\n    packed_list = []\n    current_sublist = [elements[0]]\n\n    for i in range(1, len(elements)):\n        if elements[i] == elements[i-1]:\n            current_sublist.append(elements[i])\n        else:\n            packed_list.append(current_sublist)\n            current_sublist = [elements[i]]\n    \n    packed_list.append(current_sublist)\n    return packed_list\n```"}
