{"task_id": "Mbpp/799", "solution": "```python\ndef left_rotate(n, d):\n    \"\"\"\n    Rotates the bits of a 32-bit unsigned integer n to the left by d positions.\n    Bits shifted out from the most significant end are re-inserted at the least significant end.\n    \"\"\"\n    BIT_WIDTH = 32\n    MAX_32_BIT_VALUE = (1 << BIT_WIDTH) - 1\n\n    d_effective = d % BIT_WIDTH\n    \n    part1 = (n << d_effective) & MAX_32_BIT_VALUE\n    part2 = n >> (BIT_WIDTH - d_effective)\n    \n    return part1 | part2\n```"}
