{"task_id": "Mbpp/799", "solution": "```python\ndef left_rotate(number, d):\n    \"\"\"\n    Performs a left bit rotation on a 32-bit unsigned integer.\n    The rotation amount `d` is taken modulo 32, and the result is masked to 32 bits.\n    \"\"\"\n    BITS_IN_INT = 32\n    MAX_32_BIT_VALUE = 0xFFFFFFFF\n\n    d_effective = d % BITS_IN_INT\n\n    return ((number << d_effective) | (number >> (BITS_IN_INT - d_effective))) & MAX_32_BIT_VALUE\n```"}
